### Get all tickets (no filter)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tickets

### Filter tickets by status
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tickets?status=OPEN

### Filter tickets by priority
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tickets?priority=HIGH

### Filter tickets by category
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tickets?category=Email

### Paged tickets - page 0, size 5
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tickets/paged?page=0&size=5

### Paged tickets - page 1, size 5
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tickets/paged?page=1&size=5

### Paged tickets - page 0, size 5, sortBy createdAt, direction desc
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tickets/paged?page=0&size=5&sortBy=createdAt&direction=desc

### Paged tickets - page 0, size 2
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tickets/paged?page=0&size=2

### Paged tickets - page 1, size 2
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tickets/paged?page=1&size=2

### Paged tickets - sorted by title ascending
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tickets/paged?page=0&size=5&sortBy=title&direction=asc